# Patient Appointment System (Linux)

## Overview
A command-line patient appointment management system developed in C and tested on Ubuntu.

## Features
- Add patient appointments
- View scheduled appointments
- Edit or cancel appointments
- Search patient records
- File handling for saving and loading data

## Technologies Used
- C
- Ubuntu Linux
- GCC
- Command-Line Interface

## How to Run
```bash
gcc *.c -o appointment_system
./appointment_system
